{
  "abstract": "The results of a wire chamber spectrometer experiment studying K \u2217 (890) production in the reaction K \u2212 p\u2192 K \u2212 \u03c0 + n at 13 GeV are presented. Strong forward structure is observed for | t |< m 2 \u03c0 in the s -channel density matrix elements and differential cross section. These features are similar to those observed in \u03c0 \u2212 p\u2192\u03f1 0 n data and are characteristics of \u03c0 exchange. In contrast in the intermediate, | t | \u223c 0.2 GeV 2 , and large momentum transfer regions K \u2217 (890) production is demonstrated by the natural parity \u03f1\u2212A 2 exchange contribution.",
